
[l_english.DECISION_C12_JUNGLE_TRADE]
Opening Trade Routes with Forbidden Jungle

[l_english.DECISION_C12_JUNGLE_TRADE_desc]
The Forbidden Jungle has always been a place of mystery to us. Though rumors say it is ruled by the Ahuizotl and the Daring Do who worship Harmony, we have never had any dealings with them.\nHowever, they may become our hope.\nIf we can safely deliver our goods to Foaledo, we can use Foaledo’s port to trade our products with the entire world.\nthis will be a long journey—one filled with peril.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_JUNGLE_TRADE]
开拓禁区丛林的贸易渠道

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_JUNGLE_TRADE_desc]
禁区丛林对我们此前一直是一个神秘的地方，虽然一直有传闻这里由信仰谐律的水猴和无畏天马所掌控，但我们没有与他们有任何来往，然而，他们会成为我们的希望，如果我们能把货物安全的送往佛骊多，那么我们可以凭借佛骊多的港口将商品销往全世界，但是，这会是一趟漫长的旅途，充满着风险。Foaledo
